                  {
                    "answer_bbox": [
                      248,
                      308,
                      397,
                      385
                    ],
                    "transcription": "(2) $x=0$时, $y=4$, \n$\\therefore AC=4$, $OA=4$, \n$\\because \\square ACBD$是平行四边形 \n$\\therefore AC = BD = 4$ \n$\\because OB=2$ \n$\\therefore OD=2$ \n$\\therefore D(-2, 0)$ \n$S_{\\square ACBD} = 4 \\times 4 = 16$",
